---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro'; import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro'; import TrustNote from '../components/TrustNote.astro'; import { organization } from '../data/organization';
---
<MainLayout title="Transparency" description="Review the available identity and verification information for Vijayman Unnatdhara Welfare Foundation." eyebrow="Transparency"><section class="section shell"><SectionHeading title="Trust begins with a clear record." text="We publish what has been supplied, label what is reported and keep unconfirmed information out of official claims." /><div class="content-list" style="margin-top:55px"><article class="list-card"><span class="eyebrow">Supplied by organization</span><h2>Legal name</h2><p>{organization.name}</p><h2>Section 8 licence</h2><p>{organization.identity.section8License.value} · awaits independent confirmation</p></article><article class="list-card"><span class="eyebrow">Supplied by organization</span><h2>Location</h2><p>{organization.address}</p><h2>CIN on supplied card</h2><p>{organization.identity.cin.value} · awaits independent confirmation</p></article></div><TrustNote>Third-party directory records report a different CIN and locality spelling. Those variants are retained in the project’s verification record but are not represented here as official facts.</TrustNote><div class="prose" style="margin-top:75px"><h2>Documents</h2><p>No annual reports, financial statements, certificates or activity reports have been supplied for publication yet. We will add authentic documents with their title, publication date and source once available.</p></div></section></MainLayout>
